Statement
---------
  Substantial portions of this repository are upstream code, not original
  work written from scratch. The V1 work is a thin integration layer
  (documentation, a thin `radar` CLI wrapper, intelligence file-protocol
  artifacts, and the compiled frontend artifact) built on top of the
  upstream foundation, following the principle "reuse first, modify
  minimally".

  Retained from upstream: the Python collection pipeline (httpx/static,
  Playwright/dynamic, RSS, jobs), snapshots, deterministic snapshot diff,
  Parquet raw layer, DuckDB warehouse, dbt staging to marts, static JSON
  export, Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui, tests, CI patterns,
  and static/serverless deployment. No second crawler, no second diff
  engine, no second database, and no second change-detection authority
  were introduced.

